---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Applications | Flowin pipes & fittings" description="Explore Flowin ranges by application: plumbing, drainage and agriculture. Find product families and catalogue references."><SiteHeader /><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="wrap simple-hero"><p class="kicker">Flowin for your next project</p><h1>From plumbing runs<br />to agricultural piping.</h1><p>Explore Flowin pipes and fittings for plumbing, drainage and agricultural work. Find the system specified for your project and bring the product list together.</p></section><section class="wrap application-grid" aria-label="Application paths"><article class="application-panel"><figure><img src="/images/plumbing-sergei-starostin.jpg" alt="Plumber working on a pipe connection" width="900" height="600" /></figure><div><p class="kicker">Plumbing</p><h2>Build your plumbing product list.</h2><p>Choose from Flowin uPVC and cPVC pipe and fitting families. Find the lengths, elbows, tees and couplers your next plumbing order calls for.</p><div class="application-links"><a href="/products/upvc/">uPVC plumbing</a><a href="/products/cpvc/">cPVC plumbing</a></div></div></article><article class="application-panel"><figure><img src="/images/plumber-installation-generated.png" alt="AI-generated plumber and plastic pipe application scene" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" /></figure><div><p class="kicker">Drainage</p><h2>Put your SWR order together.</h2><p>Flowin offers ring-fit and self-fit SWR pipes and fittings. Choose the joint system you need, then find its pipes, bends, tees and accessories.</p><div class="application-links"><a href="/products/swr/">SWR range</a><a href="/products/swr/ring-fit-pipes/">Ring-fit pipes</a><a href="/products/swr/self-fit-pipes/">Self-fit pipes</a></div></div></article><article class="application-panel"><figure><img src="/images/irrigation-daniel-kawed.jpg" alt="Workers fixing irrigation piping in a banana plantation" width="900" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div><p class="kicker">Agriculture</p><h2>Pipes and fittings for agricultural work.</h2><p>Explore agricultural pipes in different lengths, pressure groups and classes. Add the fittings your product list needs from the Flowin agriculture range.</p><div class="application-links"><a href="/products/agriculture/">Agriculture range</a><a href="/products/agriculture/pipes/">Pipe tables</a></div></div></article></section><section class="catalogue-banner"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>Choose Flowin for the system you need.</h2><p>Start with the product range, then check the material, size and joint specification required for your installation.</p></div><a class="solid-btn" href="/catalogue/">Open the catalogue</a></div></section></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
